Subject: [candidate] token mappings and checked kernel-object references

Not selected by any engine recipe. Reuse token kernel-object list integration
from Wine eba89375a0515957701928faac0f5007ef638b04, adapted to CX26.3's
positional object_ops. Preserve registration/grab errors, free unpublished
proxies on registration failure, and publish a referenced output only after
acquisition succeeds. The void reference API raises the acquired failure
status after unlocking rather than returning with no reference. Subject capture, locking and privilege checks remain
unimplemented. See docs/research/56-token-object-candidate-20261013.md.

